<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine industrial output up 7.8 pct Jan-April.</title>
<headline>Argentine industrial output up 7.8 pct Jan-April.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's industrial output rose 8.5 percent in April and 7.8 percent for the four months to April, the Economy Ministry said Thursday.</p>
<p>The ministry was adjusting industrial data announced by Economy Minister Roque Fernandez in a speech Wednesday, in which he said that the January-April figure was 7.0 percent.</p>
</text>
